    "zh": "用于实现和比较 Harness 演化方法的开源框架：以 recipe 和算子接入 AHE、Hyperagents、A-Evolve、GEPA，保护评估边界并保存候选谱系；在同一底模下比较 MiniSWE 与 Codex，并保留 sealed 任务检验泛化。",
    "en": "An open-source framework for implementing and comparing harness-evolution methods. Recipes compose AHE, Hyperagents, A-Evolve, and GEPA with protected evaluation and candidate lineage; experiments compare MiniSWE and Codex under the same underlying model with separate sealed tasks."
